Then lecture 9.

00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:21.480
So today we will do basically
the equivalent of entropy

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:24.600
but for non-iiid distributions.

00:24:24.600 --> 00:24:27.420
And then the next lecture
we will start looking

00:24:27.420 --> 00:24:30.492
at some practical schemes for--

00:24:30.492 --> 00:24:31.950
