00:24:40.050 --> 00:24:43.890
of lossless compression where
we will summarize everything

00:24:43.890 --> 00:24:46.185
we have learned and look
at a bunch of case studies

00:24:46.185 --> 00:24:48.555
and see how to apply lossless
